  - id: witness
    kind: 2
    title: The Watcher
    text: I saw someone cross the marsh. You followed their footsteps. Tell me - what else did you notice?
    continueLabel: Listen
    background: {fileID: 0}
    foreground: {fileID: 0}
    audioCue: {fileID: 0}
